# Nothing here is needed to build or run the app, and all of it would otherwise be
# uploaded on every deploy. The two PDFs and the prototype's leftover image account
# for roughly 3.8 MB on their own.
#
# This file has .gitignore semantics, so every entry naming a directory at the repo
# root needs the leading slash. Without it, `supabase/` also matched
# `src/lib/supabase/` and stripped the app's own Supabase clients out of the deploy —
# a build that only fails on Vercel, because locally the files are still there.
# The two globs below are unanchored on purpose.

# Source data and submission material
/Master_Database_Komersial_Compiled.xlsx
*.pdf
/src/imports/

# Database tooling — migrations run through the Supabase CLI, not through Vercel
/supabase/
/scripts/

# Tests and their artefacts
/tests/
/playwright.config.ts
/vitest.rls.config.ts
/test-results/
/playwright-report/

# Documentation
/docs/
*.md
!README.md
